# Packages added on top of the Kaggle GPU image by scripts/setup/build_wheels.py.
#
# torch / torchvision / numpy come from the image and are protected by constraints (never
# replaced). Unpinned entries keep the image's version when present, otherwise resolve to the
# newest compatible release at build time; the exact result is frozen in
# <wheelhouse>/requirements.lock.txt, which is what sessions install (offline, --no-deps).
# pointops is compiled separately from third_party/Pointcept/libs/pointops (identical CUDA
# sources to DITR's copy). Why each entry is here: docs/decisions.md (2026-10-16).
#
# {SPCONV} is filled in from torch's CUDA version (spconv 2.3.8 ships cu118/cu121/cu124/cu126).

# --- compiled, bound to torch's ABI or CUDA
spconv-{SPCONV}==2.3.8
torch-scatter
torch-cluster
SharedArray==3.2.4

# --- hard imports on the Pointcept + DITR training paths (tools/train.py import graph)
torch-geometric
open3d
addict
# DITR's config dump calls FormatCode(..., verify=True); `verify` was removed in yapf 0.40.2.
# Pointcept main works with either, so 0.40.1 serves both codebases.
yapf==0.40.1
termcolor
tensorboardX
einops
timm
peft
transformers
h5py
imageio
plyfile
albumentations
wandb
regex

# --- Sonata smoke test, ScanNet++ toolbox evaluation
huggingface_hub
munch
